            "Auto-factory doesn't support being applied to interfaces.", type, mirror);
        return ImmutableSet.of();
      }

      @Override
      public ImmutableSet<FactoryMethodDescriptor> visitExecutableAsConstructor(ExecutableElement e,
          Void p) {
